WEBVTT

00:05.330 --> 00:07.060
Bureau of Medicine?

00:07.170 --> 00:08.940
Precisely.

00:08.940 --> 00:09.970
The Bureau of Medicine...

00:09.970 --> 00:12.870
is a branch of government overseeing the imperial court.

00:13.410 --> 00:17.470
However, the Onikirimaru is beyond our control.

00:18.010 --> 00:21.350
It has the power to kill the gods and end the world.

00:22.050 --> 00:25.380
Only the blood of the
Tamayori can control it.

00:26.150 --> 00:30.060
Normally, the government wouldn't bother with this town...

00:30.060 --> 00:33.130
But this time, we don't have a choice.

00:33.130 --> 00:36.660
We should cooperate in this time of emergency.

00:37.070 --> 00:39.660
Cooperate? You mean keep an eye on.

00:40.070 --> 00:42.940
Even to us government officials,

00:42.940 --> 00:48.210
we can't have something as dangerous as the Onikirimaru stolen.

00:48.840 --> 00:52.680
If some unknown gang were to steal it and use it for evil,

00:52.680 --> 00:54.380
that would be the end of our world.

00:56.280 --> 00:59.850
There are only a few high ranking government and bureau officials...

00:59.850 --> 01:02.220
who are aware of these circumstances.

01:02.860 --> 01:09.160
Those individuals sent me here in order to prevent a worst case scenario.

01:10.870 --> 01:13.200
A businessman knows his business best,

01:13.200 --> 01:15.670
so leave the shady things to shady individuals.

01:15.670 --> 01:17.870
Anyway, that's the story.

01:21.040 --> 01:24.280
In short, our objectives are the same:

01:24.280 --> 01:25.750
the preservation of the seal.

01:25.750 --> 01:30.380
In other words, we would like to cooperate with you all.

01:32.450 --> 01:34.960
If we find that your Bureau of Medicine...

01:34.960 --> 01:39.760
can be of use to us, we will accept your proposal.

01:39.760 --> 01:41.960
I'll leave that decision...

01:41.960 --> 01:44.970
up to you, Tamaki.

01:44.970 --> 01:46.090
What?

01:48.270 --> 01:53.580
Hey who are you thinking of now?

01:53.580 --> 02:01.480
I am thinking of you

02:04.120 --> 02:06.790
I felt it when I opened my window

02:06.790 --> 02:09.060
Ah the smell of the night

02:09.060 --> 02:11.630
Whose face did I just see

02:11.630 --> 02:13.930
In my heart?

02:13.930 --> 02:16.660
When I was

02:16.660 --> 02:18.930
Soaked by the cold rain

02:18.930 --> 02:20.600
You were the only one

02:20.600 --> 02:23.540
To reach out your hand

02:23.540 --> 02:28.380
Why are you always

02:28.380 --> 02:33.010
The one to support me

02:33.010 --> 02:35.950
Each time

02:35.950 --> 02:40.220
I fall deeper in love

02:40.220 --> 02:45.460
Hey no matter what I do I want to see you

02:45.460 --> 02:50.170
Falling in love hurts

02:50.170 --> 02:52.930
You are always the only reason

02:52.930 --> 02:55.470
I feel happiness and heartache

02:55.470 --> 03:03.340
I am thinking of you

03:06.280 --> 03:14.850
Hey I want to see you

03:17.890 --> 03:21.230
The

03:17.890 --> 03:21.230
Prediction of

03:17.890 --> 03:21.230
The Bureau

03:17.890 --> 03:21.230
of Medicine

03:18.060 --> 03:21.860
Y-You're leaving the decision up to me?

03:24.500 --> 03:27.770
May I ask a question, as well?

03:27.770 --> 03:29.000
Suguru...

03:30.040 --> 03:32.110
Ashiya, was it?

03:32.110 --> 03:34.810
What is your true objective here?

03:34.810 --> 03:37.880
I can tell you want to get straight to the point.

03:37.880 --> 03:40.380
Wouldn't you normally spend a little more time getting there?

03:40.380 --> 03:42.920
I dislike wasting time.

03:42.920 --> 03:45.550
Well, it's only normal that you'd distrust me.

03:45.950 --> 03:49.390
I'm sure you're wondering, "why now?"

03:52.090 --> 03:54.730
To be honest, a battle between monsters isn't something...

03:54.730 --> 03:57.800
that humans can participate in.

03:57.800 --> 03:59.200
The truth is, we wanted to avoid it.

03:59.200 --> 04:00.440
Monsters?!

04:00.000 --> 04:00.800
You!

04:00.800 --> 04:02.600
You're in the presence of Lady Baba.

04:06.270 --> 04:09.380
However, now that things have developed to this point,

04:09.380 --> 04:13.410
we can no longer afford to remain uninvolved.

04:15.150 --> 04:18.520
Tamaki, you should recognize the truth in my words.

04:23.020 --> 04:27.090
That's why we've stayed out of it until now.

04:27.930 --> 04:31.630
But isn't it strange that the
Logos aren't making a move,

04:31.630 --> 04:34.500
despite their overwhelming strength?

04:34.500 --> 04:35.870
Yes, that's...

04:36.200 --> 04:39.270
We know the reason.

04:39.270 --> 04:40.070
What?

04:41.110 --> 04:45.570
As a government body, we do have our means.

04:46.380 --> 04:48.850
It's true that the Logos

04:48.850 --> 04:51.120
should be able to take all the Artifacts immediately.

04:51.120 --> 04:54.090
I'd thought it strange that they hadn't.

04:56.620 --> 04:58.230
So then, why?

04:58.230 --> 05:02.660
There have been some internal rifts.

05:02.660 --> 05:03.960
Internal rifts?

05:04.500 --> 05:06.600
We're still in the process of investigation,

05:06.600 --> 05:09.940
but once we have all the facts,

05:09.940 --> 05:14.430
there may be a chance that this could dissolve the Logos.

05:24.550 --> 05:25.790
I understand.

05:25.790 --> 05:27.980
I accept your proposal of cooperation.

05:28.860 --> 05:29.820
Hey!

05:29.820 --> 05:30.990
Quiet.

05:33.930 --> 05:35.660
Well done, Tamayori princess.

05:35.660 --> 05:37.630
That was a prudent decision.

05:40.130 --> 05:42.100
Who was that man?

05:42.100 --> 05:44.440
He doesn't know anything about us,

05:44.440 --> 05:46.840
and yet he calls us monsters!

05:47.340 --> 05:48.310
Shit!

05:48.310 --> 05:51.940
Can we really trust his information about Logos?

05:52.880 --> 05:54.680
I can't help but be suspicious.

05:55.380 --> 05:56.850
What are you planning,

05:56.850 --> 05:58.990
cooperating with a guy like that?

05:58.990 --> 06:01.150
Are you okay with this, Ohmi?

06:01.360 --> 06:04.160
That's not for me to decide.

06:04.960 --> 06:07.330
If it's the will of the Tamayori princess,

06:07.330 --> 06:09.800
we shall follow her to whatever ends.

06:16.240 --> 06:18.540
I know.

06:18.540 --> 06:22.840
Because the current Tamayori princess thinks we're useless,

06:22.840 --> 06:25.710
she asked that poser for help.

06:25.710 --> 06:27.850
That's not true!
That's not what I meant!

06:27.850 --> 06:29.420
Then what do you mean?

06:29.420 --> 06:30.890
What did you mean by

06:30.890 --> 06:32.650
neglecting our feelings and acting on your own?

06:32.290 --> 06:33.210
Atori.

06:38.360 --> 06:41.690
I'm sure everyone is exhausted from all the recent battles.

06:42.160 --> 06:46.070
Let's call it a day.
Is that all right, Tamaki?

06:47.100 --> 06:47.900
Yes.

06:48.240 --> 06:53.200
At times like these, we do what we must.

06:58.480 --> 07:01.420
Everyone, please get some rest.

07:12.230 --> 07:17.220
O-chan, I've hurt everyone again.

07:18.670 --> 07:22.000
But just as everyone protected me,

07:22.000 --> 07:24.130
I want to protect them.

07:24.640 --> 07:28.440
I thought that this was the only choice we had.

07:30.850 --> 07:33.780
I want to become a proper
Tamayori princess.

07:33.780 --> 07:35.350
I mean that from the bottom of my heart.

07:35.350 --> 07:37.910
There'll be hope if I do.

07:38.390 --> 07:40.580
And we'll be able to look forward.

07:43.790 --> 07:44.920
But...

07:50.000 --> 07:51.330
O-chan.

07:52.430 --> 07:53.700
Thank you.

07:53.700 --> 07:54.840
That's right.

07:54.840 --> 07:57.040
They're the ones who are really struggling.

07:57.040 --> 07:58.600
I'd better do my best, as well.

08:06.350 --> 08:07.980
I'm sorry.

08:08.420 --> 08:10.280
I'm sorry.

08:16.660 --> 08:17.780
I'm sorry.

08:18.060 --> 08:19.030
<i>Who's there?</i>

08:22.130 --> 08:23.220
<i>Who is that?</i>

08:28.300 --> 08:29.460
Don't go!

08:32.840 --> 08:36.170
Don't... go...

08:41.880 --> 08:43.250
Ready, and...

08:47.620 --> 08:50.020
I'm exhausted.

08:50.730 --> 08:52.230
Thanks, Tamaki.

08:52.230 --> 08:55.000
I know it's your lunch break, and that was really heavy.

08:55.000 --> 08:56.760
Nope. Not at all.

08:57.100 --> 09:00.500
Boys! Always skipping their daily duties.

09:00.500 --> 09:02.440
If I find them,
I'll let 'em have it!

09:04.370 --> 09:05.740
There they are!

09:06.570 --> 09:07.700
I'll see you later, then.

09:08.510 --> 09:09.310
Okay.

09:09.780 --> 09:10.750
Later!

09:11.010 --> 09:12.210
Wait!

09:17.220 --> 09:18.390
It's that late already?

09:18.390 --> 09:20.480
I'd better hurry or
I won't have time to eat...

09:24.130 --> 09:26.860
Shinji and Ms. Fiona?

09:31.970 --> 09:33.900
What are they talking about?

09:55.060 --> 09:56.820
Who's there?

10:06.470 --> 10:07.870
That guy again?

10:08.470 --> 10:10.400
Can I help you?

10:10.400 --> 10:13.200
You're the ones who came here after I did.

10:15.140 --> 10:18.540
You've got a bad smell all over you.

10:31.230 --> 10:32.890
You're lucky he didn't catch you.

10:33.730 --> 10:35.960
Wh-Wh-What?

10:44.570 --> 10:46.270
What's his problem? Jeez!

10:50.110 --> 10:52.710
Wow! Inari!

10:56.420 --> 10:58.180
They look delicious!

11:03.990 --> 11:06.930
I'll never be able to finish all of these by myself.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.600
Then I'll have some.

11:17.470 --> 11:18.530
Me, too.

11:19.040 --> 11:22.710
I can't let Kotokura's cooking go to waste.

11:22.710 --> 11:24.840
Yes. Eat as much as you'd like!

11:28.780 --> 11:30.650
Remember what Ohmi said,

11:30.650 --> 11:34.050
"in times like these, we do what we must."

11:34.890 --> 11:38.290
Making Tamaki sad, isn't something you must do, is it?

11:43.930 --> 11:45.520
Eat and feel better.

11:49.400 --> 11:51.440
After school I'm going to

11:51.440 --> 11:53.970
finally find out where the Logos are hiding.

11:55.080 --> 11:56.640
I'll go to the library.

11:57.510 --> 11:59.880
Yuichi, Shinji,

12:00.510 --> 12:01.550
thank you.

12:01.550 --> 12:03.850
I'll do my best to search the warehouse.

12:04.290 --> 12:06.050
We'll come with you.

12:06.050 --> 12:06.920
Yeah.

12:07.390 --> 12:09.520
Mahiro, you and Takuma are going to help, too?

12:09.890 --> 12:11.960
We don't have the right

12:11.960 --> 12:14.360
to refuse the wishes of the Tamayori princess.

12:16.130 --> 12:17.390
Upperclassman...

12:17.770 --> 12:20.230
It's true, isn't it?

12:23.900 --> 12:26.200
Thank you. I really appreciate your help.

12:36.780 --> 12:39.850
Woah. It's as dusty as ever.

12:41.320 --> 12:44.760
So, where and what are we looking for, and how?

12:45.430 --> 12:46.890
I have an idea.

12:47.260 --> 12:49.960
Or rather, if I'm the Tamayori princess,

12:49.960 --> 12:51.830
I should be drawn to it.

13:06.110 --> 13:08.550
I don't really like books...

13:14.790 --> 13:16.590
I'm sorry!

13:22.360 --> 13:23.730
Did you say something?

13:24.030 --> 13:25.370
Not really.

13:25.370 --> 13:26.560
Oh...

13:29.540 --> 13:30.660
I'm sorry.

13:31.170 --> 13:33.400
Who's there? Who is it?

13:35.110 --> 13:36.810
Wait! Wait!

13:36.810 --> 13:38.450
What happened?

13:38.450 --> 13:40.110
I'm sorry.

13:40.110 --> 13:41.980
Who are you? Who are you?

13:41.980 --> 13:43.350
Trapped...

13:43.350 --> 13:45.410
What does that mean?

13:45.990 --> 13:48.360
Tell me. What are you saying?

13:48.360 --> 13:49.650
I'm begging you!

13:53.230 --> 13:54.420
Tamaki!

14:04.710 --> 14:08.340
When the universe began, there was one god in heaven,

14:08.340 --> 14:09.970
Amenominakanushi.

14:10.510 --> 14:11.310
Tamaki?

14:11.310 --> 14:15.220
When the universe divided, there was one god in heaven,

14:15.220 --> 14:17.190
Amenominakanushi.

14:17.650 --> 14:20.820
A ruling god, the only god, the god of the beginning of everything,

14:20.820 --> 14:23.350
but as soon as he appeared he disappeared.

14:23.990 --> 14:26.050
Could this be a legend?

14:26.530 --> 14:28.160
In the age of the gods,

14:28.160 --> 14:31.530
the gods held the one sword of all power

14:31.530 --> 14:32.970
and conflict continued.

14:37.910 --> 14:41.940
In a battle without end, an armistice was proposed

14:41.940 --> 14:45.040
and the pure daughter of a god was made the owner of the sword.

14:50.480 --> 14:53.250
The daughter bound her blood to the sword

14:53.250 --> 14:55.690
and sealed away the sword's power forever.

14:59.090 --> 15:00.430
Her name was...

15:02.030 --> 15:04.060
her highness, the Tamayori princess.

15:06.630 --> 15:10.770
Then, for some reason, the sword's power was released.

15:11.310 --> 15:13.500
That power cleaved both heaven and earth.

15:13.810 --> 15:16.440
Everything was plunged into darkness

15:16.440 --> 15:18.380
and light disappeared.

15:19.480 --> 15:23.610
It was thought that this state would persist for a thousand years...

15:33.090 --> 15:33.960
Tamaki...

15:33.730 --> 15:34.590
Are you all right?

15:35.900 --> 15:39.160
I'm fine, thank you.

15:40.870 --> 15:43.930
I'm the Tamayori princess, aren't I?

15:50.640 --> 15:54.580
Up until now, some part of me didn't believe it.

15:56.050 --> 15:58.780
But, just now, I realized it.

15:59.590 --> 16:02.350
I am the Tamayori princess.

16:04.020 --> 16:06.130
And I heard a voice.

16:06.130 --> 16:07.090
A voice?

16:07.490 --> 16:09.400
I haven't figured out what it means yet,

16:10.560 --> 16:14.840
but I think it has something to do with me...

16:14.840 --> 16:16.430
being the Tamayori princess.

16:17.240 --> 16:19.730
That's all I've figured out so far...

16:20.670 --> 16:22.740
If that sword returns, it'll cleave...

16:22.740 --> 16:25.510
both heaven and earth, and all will be plunged into darkness.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.610
That's not very appealing.

16:28.520 --> 16:31.040
If we keep looking I'm sure something will turn up.

16:32.090 --> 16:34.450
We might find a way to defeat our enemies.

16:35.090 --> 16:36.960
There's no need for that.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.080
What?

16:38.830 --> 16:40.290
I'll tell you.

16:40.290 --> 16:43.300
The Logos have attacked this village numerous times before.

16:43.300 --> 16:46.570
Every few decades, the Tamayori's
Shugogo house has fought...

16:46.570 --> 16:49.300
with the Logos and repelled them.

16:49.300 --> 16:50.370
Mahiro?

16:50.370 --> 16:51.970
What are you saying all of a sudden?

16:51.970 --> 16:53.100
Just shut up and listen.

16:55.340 --> 16:58.480
My generation of guardians encountered the Logos as well,

16:58.480 --> 17:00.480
and we repelled the enemy.

17:00.480 --> 17:03.320
Who do you think the Tamayori princess was at that time?

17:03.320 --> 17:05.050
It couldn't be... Grandma?

17:07.320 --> 17:10.160
But Grandma never said anything about...

17:10.860 --> 17:11.860
Listen, up until now,

17:11.860 --> 17:15.490
the enemy has only ever come to investigate.

17:16.300 --> 17:18.360
They stood no chance against the powerful barrier.

17:19.170 --> 17:20.690
But this time is different.

17:21.200 --> 17:25.110
The enemy has easily passed through the barrier and,

17:25.110 --> 17:27.170
with overwhelming power, has been stealing the Artifacts.

17:28.340 --> 17:31.840
They completely destroyed us.

17:34.450 --> 17:35.710
Why?

17:36.720 --> 17:39.520
Why do you know this?

17:40.490 --> 17:41.990
Why didn't you tell us until now-

17:41.990 --> 17:45.760
Why do you think Lady Baba withheld the truth from us?

17:45.760 --> 17:46.860
Huh?

17:46.860 --> 17:48.660
The barrier has weakened.

17:48.660 --> 17:50.030
Lady Baba is getting old.

17:51.100 --> 17:54.160
And the Logos isn't a enemy that we can fight.

17:54.740 --> 17:56.800
That's... That's not true!

17:57.140 --> 17:59.540
If we keep looking, we'll find a way to-

17:59.540 --> 18:02.340
It's impossible. We can't defeat them.

18:02.340 --> 18:04.070
It's completely impossible for us.

18:04.710 --> 18:06.740
There's no point in looking for a way.

18:07.580 --> 18:08.840
Mahiro.

18:10.050 --> 18:11.040
Wait!

18:12.720 --> 18:14.650
Hey, wait!

18:16.290 --> 18:20.230
It was frightening, and surprising and seemed impossible.

18:20.230 --> 18:22.200
Mahiro, you aren't the only one who thinks so!

18:23.260 --> 18:25.830
Yuichi and Suguru and

18:25.830 --> 18:27.730
Shinji and Takuma and me,

18:27.730 --> 18:31.640
we're all worried and scared.

18:31.640 --> 18:34.270
But we're all doing our best.

18:36.080 --> 18:37.980
The upperclassman that I know,

18:37.980 --> 18:40.240
isn't someone who gives up easily.

18:41.280 --> 18:45.290
He'll raise his voice anywhere, anytime, and laugh...

18:45.290 --> 18:47.320
No matter how depressing things get,

18:47.320 --> 18:49.190
he's the kind of person who stands up to meet it.

18:50.520 --> 18:52.490
I believe he's a strong person-

18:52.490 --> 18:53.390
Shut up!

19:10.180 --> 19:12.010
Don't go saying whatever you want.

19:12.450 --> 19:14.620
In this crazy situation,

19:14.620 --> 19:17.720
I'm told to fight because the enemy has appeared,

19:17.720 --> 19:20.150
even though I know I can't win.

19:20.150 --> 19:21.820
But I fight anyway!

19:22.520 --> 19:23.960
And lose completely!

19:25.160 --> 19:27.320
I'm not as strong as you say!

19:28.360 --> 19:29.960
Don't force your ideals onto me!

19:33.870 --> 19:35.670
Let's go, upperclassman.

19:36.740 --> 19:39.440
We've done all that we can.

19:39.440 --> 19:43.070
We fought with the intention of dying.

19:44.810 --> 19:46.010
But unless...

19:47.050 --> 19:51.590
Unless I become a monster, we cannot win.

19:51.590 --> 19:53.850
That's not true! You won't lose!

19:53.850 --> 19:57.150
Takuma and Mahiro, you've always protected me.

19:58.230 --> 20:00.760
I'll get stronger this time, too!

20:00.760 --> 20:02.460
No matter how challenging it is,

20:02.460 --> 20:04.620
it's not impossible if you don't give up.

20:04.930 --> 20:07.270
I don't think you should throw away your hopes just yet.

20:07.700 --> 20:08.790
So...

20:09.870 --> 20:11.500
don't give up!

20:13.870 --> 20:15.640
Even so, I...

20:17.240 --> 20:18.740
Let's go, Takuma.

20:29.190 --> 20:31.160
I thought you were my partners.

20:32.560 --> 20:34.490
I thought we had become friends.

20:35.930 --> 20:37.060
But...

20:38.400 --> 20:41.990
did I just deceive myself into thinking I understood?

21:20.540 --> 21:24.510
From between the trees

21:24.510 --> 21:32.450
The evening sun spills onto this tree lined street

21:32.450 --> 21:37.960
Talking and laughing

21:37.960 --> 21:43.330
Mysteriously made me feel at ease

21:45.830 --> 21:52.170
Since the two of us met that day

21:52.170 --> 21:56.080
Through the time we have spent together

21:56.080 --> 22:06.080
This feeling has grown

22:09.520 --> 22:12.230
In order to protect you

22:12.230 --> 22:17.830
I am here right now

22:17.830 --> 22:23.700
You try to act strong

22:23.700 --> 22:28.480
But I will accept all your weaknesses

22:28.480 --> 22:31.310
No matter how small

22:31.310 --> 22:36.720
You can rely on me for anything

22:36.720 --> 22:44.020
If you trip I will catch you with these hands

22:53.270 --> 22:55.200
What's Drei doing?

22:55.200 --> 22:57.040
Obeying your orders.

22:57.040 --> 22:59.410
He has not left this mansion.

22:59.410 --> 23:01.200
Is there something else?

23:01.710 --> 23:05.350
On the surface he may seem complacent,

23:05.350 --> 23:08.140
but what you can see on the surface isn't everything.

23:10.050 --> 23:11.850
What is Sibyl doing?

23:11.850 --> 23:15.850
Sibyl hasn't yet lost the will to fight.

23:16.720 --> 23:19.420
If this keeps up, then sooner or later...

23:20.030 --> 23:22.260
So she still intends on disobeying...

23:22.260 --> 23:27.360
If that's the case,
I'll have to kill her next time.

23:37.910 --> 23:39.980
You want to play, too?

23:39.980 --> 23:42.580
Then come closer.

23:48.860 --> 23:50.590
Just like that.

23:50.590 --> 23:54.530
You're beautiful when you smile.

23:55.130 --> 24:01.070
Next Time: The Rumbling of the Earth
